@display("std/proto")
proto: part {
  | Binds apis to gRPC services, served over gRPC, gRPC-Web and Connect, and types to protobuf messages.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/proto/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `@proto`, `@field`, `@reserved`, `@metadata`, `@code` and their enums are specified in
  | [gRPC and Connect](#language.apis.grpc), and the encodings in [Encodings](#language.data.encodings).
}
